<< CAP LS
<< PASS pass
<< NICK vboxuser
<< USER vboxuser vboxuser 127.0.0.1 :vboxuser
>> :ircserv 421 * CAP :Unknown command
>> :ircserv 433 * vboxuser :Nickname is already in use
<< NICK vboxuser_
>> :ircserv 001 vboxuser_ :Welcome to ft_irc
<< MODE vboxuser_ +i
<< WHOIS vboxuser
>> :ircserv 403 vboxuser_ vboxuser_ :No such channel
>> :ircserv 421 vboxuser_ WHOIS :Unknown command
<< PING ircserv
>> :ircserv PONG ircserv :ircserv
--> lag pong
<< JOIN #test
>> :vboxuser_!vboxuser@localhost JOIN :#test
>> :ircserv 353 vboxuser_ = #test :@alpha beta vboxuser vboxuser_
>> :ircserv 366 vboxuser_ #test :End of /NAMES list
<< MODE #test
>> :ircserv 324 vboxuser_ #test +
--> chanquery mode
<< WHO #test
>> :ircserv 421 vboxuser_ WHO :Unknown command
<< JOIN #test2
>> :vboxuser_!vboxuser@localhost JOIN :#test2
>> :ircserv 353 vboxuser_ = #test2 :beta @vboxuser vboxuser_
